6.3 Referential Integrity
Every precedent.case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every case_relation.case_id and case_relation.related_case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every judge.case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every party.case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every work_link.case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every provenance.case_id must exist in legal_case.

Every moderation.case_id must exist in legal_case.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The case relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

Every precedent.case_reference must resolve to a case in the graph, or be flagged as unresolved.

