12. Validation Engine Design
The graph validates the following.

Validation 1. Case validity. Every case is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Work resolution.

Validation 5. Provenance completeness.

Validation 6. Audit completeness.

Validation 7. Moderation completeness.

Validation 8. Precedent resolution. Every case_reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 9. Precedent consistency. The precedent type and strength must be consistent.

Validation 10. Date consistency. The date decided must be consistent with the precedents it follows.

Validation 11. Court hierarchy consistency. The court must be consistent with the jurisdiction.

